msgid "No matrix of this survey has points on its columns."
msgstr "Aucune matrice de ce sondage n'a de points sur ses colonnes."

#. module: bf_survey_priorities
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_survey_priorities.field_survey_question__bf_one_per_column
