#. module: bf_survey_priorities
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_survey_priorities.field_survey_question_answer__bf_rank_points
msgid ""
"What a tick in this column is worth in the weighted trend of the matrix. "
"When a respondent ticks several rows in this column, the points are shared "
"between them."
msgstr ""
"Ce que vaut un choix dans cette colonne pour la tendance pondérée de la "
"matrice. Quand un répondant coche plusieurs lignes dans cette colonne, les "
"points se partagent entre elles."

